            "a7b6395A141-algprac-P04a-h1"
        ],
        "title": "Negative sign flip",
        "text": "Observe that the second term is $$\\frac{-1}{3-x}=\\frac{\\left(-1\\right)}{\\left(-x-3\\right)}=\\frac{1}{x-3}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
